on: \"Implement a shared subtract, zero, signed-less-than, and unsigned-borrow flag path for all six conditional branch predicates.\"\n  - file: test/test_pipeline.py\n    description: \"Add directed signed and unsigned branch boundary programs, including taken and not-taken cases, to validate control-flow and RVFI retirement PCs.\"\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
