h decode-derived rs1/rs2 use bits, retaining existing redirect and bus-stall priority.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/core.sv\", \"description\": \"Derive and connect IF/ID source-use classification signals to the hazard unit without altering the nret=1 interface.\"}, {\"file\": \"test/test_hazard_unit.py\", \"description\": \"Add directed cases proving real load dependencies stall once while immediate and no-source encodings with matching bit fields do not stall.\"}]}, \"expected_impact\": {\"fitness_delta_pct\": 5, \"confidence\": \"medium\"}, \"changes\": [{\"file\": \"rtl/hazard_unit.sv\", \"description\": \"Gate each load-use register comparison with decode-derived rs1/rs2 use bits, retaining existing redirect and bus-stall priority.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/core.sv\", \"description\": \"Derive and connect IF/ID source-use classification signals to the hazard unit without altering the nret=1 interface.\"}, {\"file\": \"test/test_hazard_unit.py\", \"description\": \"Add directed cases proving real load dependencies stall once while immediate and no-source encodings with matching bit fields do not stall.\"}], \"outcome\": \"broken\", \"formal_passed\": false, \"cosim_passed\": false, \"error\": \"formal_failed: reg_ch0\\n.vcd\\nSBY 22:41:51 [reg_ch0] engine_0: ##   0:00:20  Writing trace to Verilog testbench: engine_0/trace_tb.v\\nSBY 22:41:51 [reg_ch0] engine_0: ##   0:00:20  Writing trace to constraints file: engine_0/trace.smtc\\nSBY 22:41:51 [reg_ch0] engine_0: ##   0:00:20  Writing trace to Yosys witness file: engine_0/trace.yw\\nSBY 22:41:51 [reg_ch0] engine_0: ##   0:00:20  Status: failed\\nSBY 22:41:51 [reg_ch0] engine_0: finished (returncode=1)\\nSBY 22:41:51 [reg_ch0] engine_0: Status returned by engine: FAIL\\nSBY 22:41:51 [reg_ch0] summary: Elapsed clock time [H:MM:SS (secs)]: 0:00:21 (21)\\nSBY 22:41:51 [reg_ch0] summary: Elapsed process time [H:MM:SS (secs)]: 0:00:15 (15)\\nSBY 22:41:51 [reg_ch0] summary: engine_0 (smtbmc bitwuzla) returned FAIL\\nSBY 22:41:51 [r