{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_3","type":"agent_message","text":"The prior structural gains came from removing a cold critical-path operation; front-end queues and early redirects hurt Fmax, while the store buffer failed by retiring before its bus transaction was complete. I’m targeting a small in-order completion queue that hides short dmem stalls without changing retirement order or allowing an early store retirement."}}
