eement. This removes\\nthe recurring loop-back recovery bubbles without adding a RAM-based BTB or a\\npredictor-table timing path.\\n\", \"expected_impact\": {\"fitness_delta_pct\": 6, \"confidence\": \"medium\"}, \"changes\": [{\"file\": \"rtl/if_stage.sv\", \"description\": \"Recognize negative-offset conditional branches, form the B-immediate target, and advance the fetch PC to that predicted target.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/core_pkg.sv\", \"description\": \"Carry predicted-taken and predicted-next-PC metadata through the pipeline bundles to branch resolution.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/id_stage.sv\", \"description\": \"Latch IF predictor metadata alongside decoded instruction state.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/ex_stage.sv\", \"description\": \"Compare resolved branch direction and target against prediction, issuing a redirect only for a misprediction.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/hazard_unit.sv\", \"description\": \"Use the misprediction signal to flush only wrong-path work while preserving correctly predicted control-flow throughput.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/core.sv\", \"description\": \"Wire prediction metadata and misprediction recovery between fetch, execute, and hazard control.\"}, {\"file\": \"test/test_predictor.py\", \"description\": \"Add directed checks for backward-taken prediction, forward/not-taken fall-through, and final loop-exit recovery.\"}]}, \"expected_impact\": {\"fitness_delta_pct\": 6, \"confidence\": \"medium\"}, \"changes\": [{\"file\": \"rtl/if_stage.sv\", \"description\": \"Recognize negative-offset conditional branches, form the B-immediate target, and advance the fetch PC to that predicted target.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/core_pkg.sv\", \"description\": \"Carry predicted-taken and predicted-next-PC metadata through the pipeline bundles to branch resolution.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/id_stage.sv\", \"description\": \"Latch IF predictor metadata alongside decoded instruction state.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/ex_stage.sv\", \"description\": \"Compare resolved branch direction and 