queue arbitration, and redirect-flush control cost more than the transient imem stalls that prefetch can cover, so front-end decoupling needs measured slack rather than assumed stall hiding.\\ncores/bench/LESSONS.md:10:- 2026-07-10 hyp-20260710-003-r5s2 (broken, n/a): A registered lookahead BTB must treat its response PC and predicted next PC as a fetch-acceptance transaction, invalidating or holding them consistently across redirects and stalls, or stale predictions can misassociate with conditional branches and violate RVFI control-flow checks.\\n{\\n  \\\"$schema\\\": \\\"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#\\\",\\n  \\\"type\\\": \\\"object\\\",\\n  \\\"required\\\": [\\\"id\\\",\\\"title\\\",\\\"category\\\",\\\"motivation\\\",\\\"hypothesis\\\",\\\"expected_impact\\\",\\\"changes\\\"],\\n  \\\"properties\\\": {\\n    \\\"id\\\":       {\\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\", \\\"pattern\\\": \\\"^hyp-[0-9]{8}-[0-9]{3}(-r[0-9]+s[0-9]+)?$\\\"},\\n    \\\"title\\\":    {\\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\", \\\"minLength\\\": 5},\\n    \\\"category\\\": {\\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\", \\\"enum\\\": [\\\"micro_opt\\\",\\\"structural\\\",\\\"extension\\\",\\\"predictor\\\",\\\"memory\\\"]},\\n    \\\"motivation\\\":  {\\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\", \\\"minLength\\\": 20},\\n    \\\"hypothesis\\\":  {\\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\", \\\"minLength\\\": 20},\\n    \\\"expected_impact\\\": {\\n      \\\"type\\\": \\\"object\\\",\\n      \\\"required\\\": [\\\"fitness_delta_pct\\\",\\\"confidence\\\"],\\n      \\\"properties\\\": {\\n        \\\"fitness_delta_pct\\\": {\\\"type\\\": \\\"integer\\\"},\\n        \\\"confidence\\\": {\\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\", \\\"enum\\\": [\\\"low\\\",\\\"medium\\\",\\\"high\\\"]}\\n      }\\n    },\\n    \\\"changes\\\": {\\n      \\\"type\\\": \\\"array\\\", \\\"minItems\\\": 1,\\n      \\\"items\\\": {\\n        \\\"type\\\": \\\"object\\\",\\n        \\\"required\\\": [\\\"file\\\",\\\"description\\\"],\\n        \\\"properties\\\": {\\n          \\\