h.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/id_stage.sv\", \"description\": \"Latch the fetch packet's predicted next PC with the decoded instruction.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/ex_stage.sv\", \"description\": \"Compare resolved control-flow next PC against the carried prediction, emit redirects only for mismatches, and expose valid conditional-branch training fields.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/hazard_unit.sv\", \"description\": \"Use prediction mismatch as the control flush event while preserving existing load-use, divide, and bus-stall priority rules.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/core.sv\", \"description\": \"Instantiate and wire the registered lookahead predictor, predictor metadata, branch training, and mismatch recovery without changing the nret=1 top-level contract.\"}, {\"file\": \"test/test_predictor.py\", \"description\": \"Add directed tests for sequential lookahead warm-up, repeated taken loops, final not-taken exits, target-entry misses after redirects, aliases, and bus-stall/RVFI correctness.\"}], \"outcome\": \"broken\", \"formal_passed\": false, \"cosim_passed\": false, \"error\": \"formal_failed: insn_beq_ch0\\n32:10 [insn_bltu_ch0] engine_0: ##   0:05:53  Writing trace to Yosys witness file: engine_0/trace.yw\\nSBY 22:32:10 [insn_bltu_ch0] engine_0: ##   0:05:53  Status: failed\\nSBY 22:32:10 [insn_bltu_ch0] engine_0: finished (returncode=1)\\nSBY 22:32:10 [insn_bltu_ch0] engine_0: Status returned by engine: FAIL\\nSBY 22:32:10 [insn_bltu_ch0] summary: Elapsed clock time [H:MM:SS (secs)]: 0:05:53 (353)\\nSBY 22:32:10 [insn_bltu_ch0] summary: Elapsed process time [H:MM:SS (secs)]: 0:04:53 (293)\\nSBY 22:32:10 [insn_bltu_ch0] summary: engine_0 (smtbmc bitwuzla) returned FAIL\\nSBY 22:32:10 [insn_bltu_ch0] summary: counterexample trace: insn_bltu_ch0/engine_0/trace.vcd\\nSBY 22:32:10 [insn_bltu_ch0] summary:   failed assertion rvfi_testbench._witness_.check_flatten_checker_inst__assert_rvfi_insn_check_sv_198_152 at rvfi_insn_check.sv:198.6-198.31 step 20\\nSBY 22:32:10 [insn_bltu_ch0] DONE (