ta flops with a distributed-RAM-friendly unreset array plus resettable valid bitmap, retaining x0 masking and write-first dual-read semantics.\"\n  - file: test/test_reg_file.py\n    description: \"Add reset-after-write, invalid-entry zero-read, and same-cycle write-first tests to prove the valid-mask implementation preserves architectural register-file behavior.\"\nYAML structure checks passed\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
