rediction transaction under stalls.\\n\", \"expected_impact\": {\"fitness_delta_pct\": 4, \"confidence\": \"medium\"}, \"changes\": [{\"file\": \"rtl/core_pkg.sv\", \"description\": \"Add fetch-payload validity, PC, and branch-only predicted-successor fields to keep each prediction bound to its decoded instruction.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/if_stage.sv\", \"description\": \"Implement the single-ahead registered payload, sequential lookahead fetch, atomic predicted-branch discard, and priority-ordered EX recovery.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/id_stage.sv\", \"description\": \"Recognize valid backward conditional branches from the registered payload and emit a prediction only on an actual ID/EX acceptance.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/ex_stage.sv\", \"description\": \"Carry branch-only prediction metadata and compare resolved direction and target only for a predicted branch before requesting recovery.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/hazard_unit.sv\", \"description\": \"Define acceptance, hold, and flush precedence for imem/dmem stalls, load-use stalls, divider ownership, predicted discard, and EX recovery.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/core.sv\", \"description\": \"Wire fetch acceptance, branch prediction metadata, and qualified recovery without changing the nret=1 top-level interface.\"}, {\"file\": \"test/test_predictor.py\", \"description\": \"Add directed taken-loop, final-exit, forward-branch, imem-stall, dmem-stall, and divider-hold tests for atomic sequential-payload discard and RVFI PC order.\"}]}, \"expected_impact\": {\"fitness_delta_pct\": 4, \"confidence\": \"medium\"}, \"changes\": [{\"file\": \"rtl/core_pkg.sv\", \"description\": \"Add fetch-payload validity, PC, and branch-only predicted-successor fields to keep each prediction bound to its decoded instruction.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/if_stage.sv\", \"description\": \"Implement the single-ahead registered payload, sequential lookahead fetch, atomic predicted-branch discard, and priority-ordered EX recovery.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/id_stage.sv\", \"d