ructions and traps use neither. Keep the existing\\none-cycle stall for every true dependency, so the MEM/WB forwarding boundary\\nand the dmem-to-EX timing path remain unchanged while false interlocks no\\nlonger cost CoreMark issue cycles.\\n\", \"expected_impact\": {\"fitness_delta_pct\": 3, \"confidence\": \"medium\"}, \"changes\": [{\"file\": \"rtl/decoder.sv\", \"description\": \"Expose validated decode-local uses-rs1 and uses-rs2 signals, defaulting both low for illegal or operand-free encodings.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/id_stage.sv\", \"description\": \"Route the decoded source-use qualifiers alongside the IF/ID decode outputs without changing operand capture or pipeline payload timing.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/core.sv\", \"description\": \"Wire source-use qualifiers from decode into the load-use hazard decision.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/hazard_unit.sv\", \"description\": \"Gate each load-use register comparison with the corresponding architecturally consumed source and IF/ID valid while preserving dmem, redirect, and divide priorities.\"}, {\"file\": \"test/test_pipeline.py\", \"description\": \"Add directed adjacent-load cases for real rs1/rs2 dependencies and each operand-free or single-source encoding, checking both architectural results and bubble behavior.\"}]}, \"expected_impact\": {\"fitness_delta_pct\": 3, \"confidence\": \"medium\"}, \"changes\": [{\"file\": \"rtl/decoder.sv\", \"description\": \"Expose validated decode-local uses-rs1 and uses-rs2 signals, defaulting both low for illegal or operand-free encodings.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/id_stage.sv\", \"description\": \"Route the decoded source-use qualifiers alongside the IF/ID decode outputs without changing operand capture or pipeline payload timing.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/core.sv\", \"description\": \"Wire source-use qualifiers from decode into the load-use hazard decision.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/hazard_unit.sv\", \"description\": \"Gate each load-use register comparison with the corresponding architecturally co